Package: enhancedTtest
Title: Enhanced T-Test with Automatic Selection and APA Formatting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Martin",
           family = "Nyamu",
           email = "analystnyamu79@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides enhanced t-test functionality with automatic 
    assumption checking, non-parametric fallbacks, effect size calculation, 
    and APA-formatted tables that can be exported to Word documents. Supports 
    one-sample, two-sample, and paired t-tests with intelligent test selection.
